{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54425","headline":"江南女 · 崔致远","name":"江南女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南荡风俗，养女娇且怜。\n性冶耻针线，妆成调管弦。\n所学非雅音，多被春心牵。\n自谓芳华色，长占艳阳年。\n却笑邻家女，终朝弄机杼。\n机杼纵劳身，罗衣不到汝。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}